      "id": 37731,
      "name": "Trepo",
      "slug": "trepo",
      "former_names": [],
      "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/b665bafb6e74d729c276a76da1d06f81bdac762a.png",
      "website": "https://hellotrepo.com/",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "Trepo is building agents that shop for you, starting with groceries.\r\n\r\nTo know what your household needs, a shopper has to understand what happens at home. Today, that information is scattered across cupboards, receipts, recipes, and the people living there, leaving one person to remember what’s running low, what needs using, and what’s for dinner.\r\n\r\nOur Kitchen Assistant and connected app help households track their food, decide what to cook, and use what they already have. A shared device lives in the kitchen, where groceries are unpacked, meals are prepared, and leftovers are saved. That makes it easy to keep Trepo informed as those things happen, giving our agents the context to understand what your household needs and buy it for you.\r\n\r\nWe’re starting with food. Our ambition is a home that knows what it has, what it needs, and what to do next.",
      "one_liner": "The agentic grocery shopper that knows what you have and need.",
